WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.900
Narrator: If HOT says suspicious, follow these steps.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.100
Narrator: One: don't touch it.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.100
Narrator: Two: calmly ask the people right next to it to move away with you.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Narrator: Three: step back at least fifteen metres before you use your radio or phone - radios and phones can be a risk close to some items.

5
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.100
Narrator: Then get out of line of sight, behind something solid.

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:36.800
Narrator: Four: radio your supervisor. Say 'Item of Interest', where it is, what it looks like, why it worries you, and what you are doing.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Narrator: Never say 'bomb'.

8
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.400
Narrator: Five: if someone else found it, ask them to stay with you so they can brief Security or the Police.

